              "document_hash": "c3f0f38cf9abade9232171ed39804c6bb24837048492de241f3c728ea273914f",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-c3f0f38cf9ab-0000-0002"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 3,
                "start": 3
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Bielski, bielski\u2019s arguments to overcome the Griggs principle are unpersuasive, because appellate courts have tools to prevent unwarranted delay and deter frivolous interlocutory appeals."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Bielski",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "c3f0f38cf9abade9232171ed39804c6bb24837048492de241f3c728ea273914f",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-c3f0f38cf9ab-0001-0000"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 11,
                "start": 11
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "Bielski does not argue that Coinbase\u2019s appeal in this case is frivolous."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Bielski",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "c3f0f38cf9abade9232171ed39804c6bb24837048492de241f3c728ea273914f",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-c3f0f38cf9ab-0001-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 12,
                "start": 12
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Bielski, requiring an automatic stay would create a special, arbitration\u2011preferring procedural rule."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Bielski",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
      "summary_citations": []
    },
    {
      "claims": [
        {
          "attribution": "Coinbase, Inc.",
          "citations": [
            {
