                "start": 4
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Coinbase, Inc., coinbase argues that an appeal of the denial of a motion to compel arbitration stays the litigation, following the divestiture rule and FAA Section\u202f16(a)."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Coinbase, Inc.",
