              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Katyal, courts have mechanisms in every circuit to weed out frivolous appeals, such as district\u2011court motions to expedite or return jurisdiction."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioner (Neal K. Katyal)",
          "citations": [
